	"data": "ThoughtBubbles-as-RDF: Vault SPARQL Queries\n\nSample queries for the vault knowledge graph. These demonstrate what becomes possible when the vault's wikilink structure is treated as a typed knowledge graph.\n\nStructural Queries (wikilinks only)\n\nThese work with obsidian-sparql's auto-triplification — no semantic extraction needed.\nFind all concepts that link to ThoughtBubbles\n\nCurrent result: 50 concepts link to ThoughtBubbles — it's the #1 authority node in the graph.\nFind concepts with the most…",
